# Stop → tar these paths → start. Valheim has no save command that can be sent from outside; it
# saves every 20 minutes and on shutdown. Only a stopped server gives a consistent copy.
#
# The whole worlds folder, not single files: a Valheim 1.0 world is a directory of many files,
# an older world is a .db/.fwl pair that only loads together, and the server keeps .old copies.
data/config/worlds_local
# Access control. Without them a restored server lets everyone in and nobody is admin.
data/config/adminlist.txt
data/config/bannedlist.txt
data/config/permittedlist.txt
# BepInEx config, plugins and patchers (only present with VALHEIM_BEPINEX=true).
data/config/bepinex
# Not listed: data/server (game files, downloaded again from Steam at start).
